Drom
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 8 DEAL CRUIQ
JAQ 10 FACE_ALL
JAQ 9 FACE_HALF
JAQ 6 FACE_HALF
JAQ 0 FACE_HALF
JAQ 4 FACE_HALF

CRUIQ 7 FACE_ALL
CRUIQ 8 FACE_ALL
CRUIQ 0 FACE_ALL
CRUIQ 0 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE CRUIQ CRUIQ
DESTSRC Rank add_13
MOVE JAQ CRUIQ
DESTSRC Suit match_color
MOVE_STACK CRUIQ CRUIQ
AND
    OR
        SRCSTACK Rank add_14
        DEST Rank K
    DEST Empty
MOVE_STACK JAQ CRUIQ
AND
    DEST Empty
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
        SRCSTACK Size < 9
DRAW
PILE ALL JAQ Size > 0
$win
PILE ALL CRUIQ Empty
